# P0-12 regression (LIGGGHTS modernization branch, cleanup agent).
# Minimal deck: the Domain constructor creates the default "lattice none 1.0"
# before LAMMPS::force exists. Run with a -fsanitize=address,undefined build
# WITH the vptr check (no -fno-sanitize=vptr). Before the fix UBSan reported a
# member call on an invalid Force pointer at startup (SEGV with vptr on).
# Also exercises an explicit "lattice none" to keep its input validation.
units si
lattice none 2.0
region reg block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units box
create_box 1 reg
print "STARTUP_OK"
